## Matched styling (client half)

The CSS values in `src/client/styles.ts` are matched to the shipped DSH web
shell panels so this plugin's surfaces sit in the same visual system. The DSH
client packages are MIT-licensed:

| Package family | Licence | Copyright |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-*` (styling values matched) | MIT | Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek |

No DSH source code is bundled into `lib/client.js`; React and the other platform
modules stay external and are provided by the shell.

## Dev-only dependencies

Everything in `devDependencies` is used to build, type-check or test this
package and is **not** part of the installed plugin (React is a peer dependency
provided by the shell). Their licence texts remain in their own packages.

